          "description": "Find and rank indexed restaurant meals near a US ZIP code or coordinates, using Empirical app nutrition scoring and optional hard nutrient limits. No authentication. Searches up to 50 nearest indexed restaurants; returns up to 20 meals. Missing nutrients never satisfy a requested limit. Returns nutrition source labels; no live availability, allergy safety, ordering, or meal logging.",
